    "detailed_description": "This game is not a classic Japanese horror game where you can't fight back against the ghosts.<br />\r\nIn Kinki Spiritual Affairs Bureau, you're just as much of a threat as the spirits themselves!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Description:<br />\r\nFight, gun shooting and stealth action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story takes place in Japan, where exorcisms are carried out by government agents.<br />\r\nThe protagonist is Mizuki Shiraishi, who is an exorcist from the Kinki Spiritual Affairs Bureau.<br />\r\nShiraishi visits Saiga Village in Nara to investigate a mystery in which all trances of the village have been wiped off the internet.<br />\r\nUpon her arrival, she discovers all villagers have gone missing and the village is infested with a disproportionate number of unlawful spirits.<br />\r\nElectricity, communications, and the internet in the village have been all cut-off,<br />\r\nand Shiraishi also finds out that someone is pulling the strings behind the incident.<br />\r\nShiraishi pursues the mystery with radio assistance from her boss Kohinata and her junior co-worker Maruoka.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNOTE:<br />\r\nThere are no restrictions on monetization on your stream of this game.",
    "about_the_game": "This game is not a classic Japanese horror game where you can't fight back against the ghosts.<br />\r\nIn Kinki Spiritual Affairs Bureau, you're just as much of a threat as the spirits themselves!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContent Description:<br />\r\nFight, gun shooting and stealth action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story takes place in Japan, where exorcisms are carried out by government agents.<br />\r\nThe protagonist is Mizuki Shiraishi, who is an exorcist from the Kinki Spiritual Affairs Bureau.<br />\r\nShiraishi visits Saiga Village in Nara to investigate a mystery in which all trances of the village have been wiped off the internet.<br />\r\nUpon her arrival, she discovers all villagers have gone missing and the village is infested with a disproportionate number of unlawful spirits.<br />\r\nElectricity, communications, and the internet in the village have been all cut-off,<br />\r\nand Shiraishi also finds out that someone is pulling the strings behind the incident.<br />\r\nShiraishi pursues the mystery with radio assistance from her boss Kohinata and her junior co-worker Maruoka.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNOTE:<br />\r\nThere are no restrictions on monetization on your stream of this game.",
